      "message": "\"Does not rewrite code\" isn\u0027t quite true any more: under precise counting a module\u0027s run-format code is rewritten as it loads (`vali_bytecode::ownership`; ADR 0003, as 1260820 says). The point here, that caches never patch code, still holds. Something like \"loading fills in per-module tables, and nothing patches code to cache\" would be exact.",
      "revId": "bf956b5c4c46618eb022b8040cfb6a10eb0bde8d",
